<title>UK: Britannia bids for British Building.</title>
<headline>Britannia bids for British Building.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Building &amp; Engineering Appliances Plc said on Thursday it had received an approach from British construction group and property developer Britannia Group Plc which could lead to a takeover offer.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
